<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan Tatung Jan-June net up 15.6 pct.</title>
<headline>Taiwan Tatung Jan-June net up 15.6 pct.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>January-June 1996</p>
<p>			 (in million T$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Turnover			    21,405 vs 17,997</p>
<p>    Pretax profit			3,803 vs  3,323</p>
<p>    Net profit			   3,810 vs  3,295</p>
<p>NOTE - Tatung Co Ltd is one of Taiwan's biggest electric appliance makers. The firm's higher net profit than pretax was due to a tax refunding.</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (5080815)</p>
</text>
